window.products.push({"id":453037,"name":"sherry Reusable Food Storage Bags,10 Pack Reusable Ziplock Bags Bread Box Set (4 Reusable Snack Bags 4 Reusable Lunch Bags 2 packs Gallon Freezer Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dcFl1Q-UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you still using plastic bags? 100,000 or more marine animals are killed each year due to plastic pollution. 120,000 pieces of plastic pollute each square kilometre of the ocean(on average). 1,000,000 or more sea-birds are killed each year due to plastic pollution. 35,400,000 tonnes of plastic go into landfills in America each year. 1,000,000,000,000 plastic bags are used every year around the world. Plastics have killed countless seabirds, fish and other marine life, and are gradually bringing toxins back to humans through the food chain. According to recent study, the average American could be consuming over 74,000 microplastic particles per year. Why choose reusable bags ♻Safe: Truely FDA grade certificated reusable storage bags that is PVC, BPA, Chloride and Lead free. ♻ ECO-friendly: Peva material is recyclable and not harmful to the environment when disposed or burned. ♻ Durable: One SPLF reusable bag CAN SAVE UP To 300 disposable bags. ♻ Leak Proof: Double ziplock closures ensures an airtight seals in freshness. ♻ Kids Friendly: upgraded zipper design that is easy for children to open and close. ♻ Freezer Safe: Perfect for storing and preserving food.  ♻ Multi Purpose: Perfect storage bags for lunch, foods, snack, fruit, vegetable, sandwiches, pet food, travel, make-up, home and kitchen organization and more. Tips ⚠️Hand wash and air dry ⚠️Not suitable for hot food ⚠️Do not place in the dishwasher ⚠️Do not use in microwave - the heat will cause the bags to warp Package Contains - Reusable gallon bags x2; - Reusable sandwich bags x4; - Reusable snack bags x 4;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dcFl1Q-UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sherry","source_asin":"B082SWJPW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082SWJPW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082SWJPW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
