window.products.push({"id":453172,"name":"QUBIC INC Garlic Press Mini Chopper Garlic Mincer Slicer Dicer Grater Miniature Alligator Chopper Press for Garlic, Soft Vegetables, Nuts, Foods. Two ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511O9hBGlJL._AC_.jpg","description":"The simple garlic press, slicer, and the small size of the garlic chopper makes it portable enough to fit in any kitchen draw. All the units can be neatly snapped inside the mini chopper garlic mincer after you use them for convenient and compact storage. Cleaning is so easy. Just rinse under a faucet and let it dry. May be cleaned by wiping with a cloth but take care not to have your fingers or hand touch the sharp blades The Garlic Chop cuts fresh garlic quickly and easily without transferring strong odors to your hands! If you love Garlic as much as we do, look no further than the SDL Garlic Press Garlic is one thing that is guaranteed to enhance any dish. Lots of people stay away from it because the preparation, although not difficult, can leave a lingering odor on your hands for days to come. * This Garlic Press is different to the others as it gives you the option to either slice or dice the Garlic * There is no removal of blades or inserting new pieces. Just turn the gadget upside down if you want your garlic sliced instead of diced * Once you have closed the lid on the gadget allowing it to do it's job, just pull out the clear tray which holds your prepared fresh garlic * The Garlic Cube is easily stowed and is an attractive product which will impress your friends when they come to visit. Measurements are Height: 3 Inches, Width: 2.5 inches, Depth: 2.5 inches - It weighs just 6 ounces * You can either wash the Garlic Press by putting it under tap water or if you prefer, it is completely dishwasher safe * This Garlic Press is so easy and fun to use. You do not need to be as strong as an Ox to use it. You just place the garlic as directed, close the lid and job done. Easy as that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511O9hBGlJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUBIC INC","source_asin":"B01JZI16U0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JZI16U0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JZI16U0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":453173,"name":"LubriMatic 75-501 Galvanized Steel Utility Funnel - 1 Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aZXw3-J3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plews LubriMatic's rugged galvanized steel funnel has a multitude of uses in home garages, shops, industrial facilities, farms, and more. This ruggedly constructed funnel has a 1-quart capacity from spout tip to top of fill reservoir. Measures 7-inches in total height with a 6-inch diameter tapered fill reservoir that makes filling easy. Large 3/4-inch outside diameter tip offers good flow volume, even with thicker fluids. Use with gasoline, oil, chemicals, water, and more. Plews Manufacturing and Sales Corporation was originally founded by R. G. Plews in 1927. At that time, the railroad industry was the primary focus for the company’s extensive line of oil cans. As the transportation industry went from trains to passenger cars and trucks, Plews shifted their focus to developing the tools necessary to service this new mode of transportation. Fast forward 90 years and Plews has become part of Plews & Edelman. Today, Plews & Edelmann is a leading designer, manufacturer and distributor of a broad range of automotive parts and tools sold to the vast majority of mass merchant, retail auto parts stores and wholesale automotive parts and industrial distribution outlets, worldwide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aZXw3-J3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LubriMatic","source_asin":"B000AYDXZ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000AYDXZ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000AYDXZ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
