window.products.push({"id":453236,"name":"GREAT ART Poster – Machu Picchu – Picture Decoration South America Peru Historical Cultural Sites Inca City Ruins UNESCO World Heritage Image Photo De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Q96YHKbfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wall decoration for your home by GREAT ART Our stylish poster is a guaranteed eye-catcher in any room. Whether living room, office, playroom or bedroom – bring a stop to your bare, white walls.  The Machu Picchu Mountain in Peru near the city of Cusco preserves a pearl of the world culture - a well-preserved ruin city built in the 15th century by the Incas, at an altitude of 2430 meters on a ridge between the Andes and the Urubamba Valley. The terraced complex is accessible via a narrow mountain path or the so-called Inca Trail. Since 1983, the Monte Picchu has been on the list of UNESCO World Heritage Sites and has been one of the world's seven new wonders. Not a surprise that the Inca attracts crowds of visitors. Enjoy the view of the mountain city and let yourself enchanted by the majestically rising bright orange glowing sky towering the mountain and feel the magic of the Inca city Machu Picchu. The mural consists of 1 – part, with overall dimensions of 55 x 39.4 Inch / 140 cm x 100 cm in high quality, so you can install the image on a wall or a different surface (plywood, MDF). Highlights: high quality print – great resolution and well covering colours. sturdy material – eligible as mural, you can paper it on already existing wallpaper. scope of delivery: ✅ Machu Picchu Posters Peru 55 x 39.4 Inch /140cm x 100cm - 1 piece ✅ instructions Additionally with your order you will receive a free XXL New York Skyline Poster sized 47,24 x 16,53 Inch / 120 x 42 cm, as well as another random poster sized 55 x 39.4 Inch / 140 x 100 cm. Perfect as a decoration in another room or as gift for friends or acquaintances . Check out our shop for more designs, art, special offers and discounts, just type in GREAT ART in your Amazon searching bar!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Q96YHKbfS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREAT ART","source_asin":"B00TODCNOU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TODCNOU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TODCNOU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
