window.products.push({"id":453241,"name":"Rae Dunn Kitchen Gnome - Home Decor Decorations - Scandinavian/Swedish/Nordic Tomte Nisse Plush Figurine - 19\" Elf with Beard Ornament for Shelf, Tabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WiSAsuMyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the joy of whimsical decor with this cute Kitchen Gnome from Rae Dunn! With felt nose, white fiber beard, knitted arms and plush body this charming little gnome has a hat featuring a fun kitchen themed message in Rae Dunn’s signature font. Choose from “Kiss the Cook” or “Welcome to My Kitchen” - or collect them both, so they can keep each other company!PRODUCT FEATURES: Soft Plush Felt Material Traditional Good Luck Charm Weighted with Sand Dimensions: 19.25” x 7” x 5.25”DECORATE YOUR KITCHEN IN STYLETransport yourself to a fairytale world of wonder & whimsy with these adorable self-standing plush gnomes. These mythological beings from Nordic folklore are called “nisse” or “tomten” and figurines of them are traditionally handcrafted as good luck charms.Our nifty gnome is 19.25” tall and has a bottom filled with sand so he stays upright without toppling over. Adorn entryways, bedrooms, desktops, nurseries, offices, tables, mantles, windowsills, bookcases, shelves, refrigerators, nooks and crannies with this plush figurine and keep the mood always fun & festive!RAE DUNNCalifornia artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. “In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.”Rae’s designs are known for their functionality, design and durability. Rae’s signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WiSAsuMyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B09L2V6RM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L2V6RM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L2V6RM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
