window.products.push({"id":453343,"name":"PRYNEX Bread Proofing Basket with Accessories - 9\" Round Natural Rattan Banneton Basket, Stainless Steel Lame with 5 Blades, Silicone Dough Scraper - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qjZGy+DoS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Tired of the misshapen doughs you keep churning out in the kitchen? Creating the perfect bread is rarely ever easy. Even after meticulously mixing the best ingredients in their appropriate measurements, you can still come up with misshapen doughs. Don’t give up just yet. Your dream of creating your own artisan bread at home is within reach. With the right tools, you can create magic in the kitchen. The PRYNEX Bread Proofing Baskets with Accessories will help you produce perfect artisan breads every time! This set lets you create perfectly shaped doughs with each try. You get a 9-inch-round proofing basket that is designed to help you produce mouthwatering sourdough bread. You’ll love creating artisan doughs in your own kitchen! Our set is designed to be with you every step of the process. The included silicone scraper with measurements that allows you to scrape, mix, cut, and chop pastry doughs easily. You'll also get a stainless-steel lame, so you can score your bread any way you want. We don’t make compromises when it comes to quality. To give you peace of mind, our basket is made from 100% natural rattan that does not contain any harmful substances or splinters. This allows you to bake as much as you want without any worries. Plus, our basket is easy to clean and maintain! Here are more reasons to love our bread proofing set: 👩‍🍳 Premium design  👩‍🍳 Top-grade materials for extreme durability 👩‍🍳 Kind to the planet Choose a set that meets all your needs. Add the PRYNEX Bread Proofing Baskets with Accessories to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qjZGy+DoS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PRYNEX","source_asin":"B08TLN1NFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLN1NFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLN1NFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":453344,"name":"Love My Frenchie French Bulldog Custom Name Fleece Throw Blanket - Personalized Lightweight Snuggly Blankets for Dogs Dog Lovers Mom Dad Kids Family T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhY3CdRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rhY3CdRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07VVRLRMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVRLRMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVRLRMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
