window.products.push({"id":453365,"name":"Relaxare Cal King 300TC 100% Egyptian Cotton White Solid 4PCs Sheet Set Solid (Pocket Size: 13 inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QK7oHCgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We offer supreme quality Egyptian Cotton bed linens.These soft, smooth and silky high quality and durable bed linens come to you at a very low price as these come directly from the manufacturer.Cal-King Bedding Size (Fitted/Flat/Pillowcase))(72Inches x 84Inches 102Inches x 110Inches 20Inches x 40Inches).Premium high thread count cotton rich blend to protect and beautify your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QK7oHCgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Relaxare","source_asin":"B01F2ATIAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F2ATIAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F2ATIAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":453366,"name":"Smart Living Corn Butter Spreader - Great for Barbeques & Family Dinners - 100% Guarantee Through Land Essentials","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618S-svD5VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are a million useless kitchen gadgets out there, most of which are scheming to kill you (their anger and resentment boils over when they're left unused in your kitchen drawers). But here's one kitchen gadget that's actually useful and rarely homicidal. Tired of your children handling butter sticks like lubricated, electric eels? This corn-shaped butter holder prevents your Land-o-Lakes from becoming a projectile bent on eye injury. Simply drop a stick of butter into the holder, grab the holder and glide the butter across your hot food - your hands never touch the butter. When your stick of butter starts to run down, just push the bottom support piece up to replenish your butter levels, your fingers still won't touch the butter. The butter stick clings to the holder's walls & bottom support, so it won't fall down (though if you butter priapism lasts for more than four hours after your meal, please contact your dietician).  Use this butter holder to apply butter to just about anything or even anyone. While we're all for food foreplay, please ask your significant other for written consent prior to applying butter. This durable butter holder can be kept in the fridge (with the butter) when not in use and can endure your dishwasher for easy cleaning (preferably without the butter, unless you like your dishes all shiny). Best to properly butter your corn now with this gadget, as there might not even be any corn next year. Global warming will undoubtedly turn all our corn crops into pop corn. If global warming doesn't destroy our corn crops, surely the zombie apocalypse will (or didn't your dietician tell you that vegan zombies eat grains and not brains?). So, enjoy properly buttered corn while you can and treat yourself to the one kitchen gadget you actually need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618S-svD5VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Living","source_asin":"B01EP4SA6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EP4SA6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EP4SA6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
