window.products.push({"id":453431,"name":"Roundsy Stainless Steel Dutch Dough Whisk 12 inch, Flat Whisk, Cutting board Scraper and Set of 3 Plastic Dough Scraper, Cooking Utensils, Baking and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gcjGvxZrL._AC_.jpg","description":"Mix an amazing dough with this enduring Danish dough whisk from Roundsy. Made from high quality stainless steel, this classic hook shaped dough completely mixes wet and dry ingredients in the dough with perfection. It’s very simple to whip up a batch of your favorite baked items without having a thick coating of dough sticking to your spoon, whisk, or hand. The thing that’s even better is that, this whisk is 100% dishwasher safe for easy cleaning.  Made of solid thick steel wire. At Roundsy, we believe that the time spent during cooking must be fun! We aim to enhance our customers relationship with cooking by designing such products that have amazing performance and real enjoyment. We also want to be the leader of kitchen tool innovation while bringing smiles to our customer face. Our products make home chefs feel professional, confident and happy in the kitchen. Teach your children your grandmother’s secret recipe. Amaze your co-workers with a delicious treat. Share the happiness of cooking, baking and eating as it brings us all together. Product Specifications: Material: Top Quality Stainless SteelColor: SilverSize: 12x3.3x1 inchesWeight: 4.6 ounces High quality and enduring solid stainless-steel frame used, Environment friendly Environment friendly Great gift for baking / bakery lovers. Great gift for baking / bakery lovers. Well packed for safety Well packed for safety Nice and durable Nice and durable Package Contains: 1x Stainless Steel Dough Whisk 1x Stainless Steel Dough Whisk 1x Egg Beater Whisk 1x Egg Beater Whisk 1x Stainless Steel Scraper 1x Stainless Steel Scraper 1x Plastic Cream Scraper 1x Plastic Cream Scraper 1x Plastic Dough Cutter 1x Plastic Dough Cutter 1x Plastic Dough Scraper 1x Plastic Dough Scraper We have included the best stainless-steel material with best finishing. This product is eco-friendly and absolutely safe for both adults and Kids. The product is well packed to ensure that its not damaged during transit. So what are you waiting for? Click &ldq","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gcjGvxZrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RDY","source_asin":"B08QDJX31Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QDJX31Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QDJX31Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
