window.products.push({"id":453568,"name":"Pioneer Photo Albums 36-Pocket 4 by 6-Inch Embroidered \"Memories\" Strap Sewn Leatherette Cover Photo Album, Mini, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e267f2keL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From Pioneer's Expressions series, this \"memories\" embroidered hook and loop material closure strap album features a blue sewn leatherette cover. The album holds 36 4\"x6\" photos in optically clear pockets with a black mesh background. The album is book style bound and photos are displayed one per page. The acid, lignin and PVC-free archival design keeps photographs safe over time. The album measures 6.5\" x 5.125\" x .75\". Style No. EXP-46/BM.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e267f2keL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pioneer Photo Albums","source_asin":"B00GX3ZM92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GX3ZM92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GX3ZM92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":453569,"name":"Mother Poem - Mother Present - Mother Verse - Mothers Birthday - Mom Poem - Mom Verse - Mom 60th 70th 80th Birthday Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Cbo8YDuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful, heart-stirring verse depicts a mother's journey, as she travels through life with her child. If you are a mother, this will surely bring tears to your eyes as you read. It was created by nationally recognized poet, Genie Graveline. This quality product is 8 x 10 in size. It is double matted. The Verse is...... A Mother’s Hands...... When a woman first becomes a mother, her hands begin a job...... which will carry her through a lifetime. Soft and young, they’re perfect for caressing, dressing and undressing, playing patty-cake, powdering bottoms, and the many other tasks which she so blissfully embraces. As she grows into motherhood the tasks multiply. Willingly, her hands turn the pages of your favorite books, tie your laces, test your bath water, apply bandaids to your cuts & scrapes, wipe your tears, wash away the fingerprints that mark your path, and steady you...as you begin to make your way through life. Then, years later, when you’re really on the run, those hands pick up your dirty socks, iron your clothes, cook for you, jot down your phone messages, and clean up after you...time and time again. They’re beginning to show their age. During the teenage years, they turn down the stereo, relinquish the car keys, hand over untold amounts of money, close your bedroom door when the mess becomes unbearable...loosen their grasp, and pray...they do a lot of that. Finally, when a mother’s children are all grown up, her hands get a little rest. She has time to look at them now, and she’s...... caught off-guard when she sees just how much they have changed. Still, she manages a smile, for she knows that those hands have done a lot of wonderful things. They’re a Mother’s Hands.. altered, perhaps, with the passage of time...but beautiful just the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Cbo8YDuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genie's Poems","source_asin":"B0012TIMMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0012TIMMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0012TIMMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
