window.products.push({"id":453634,"name":"Universal Popcorn Speed Scoop - Left and Right-Handed Serving Tool - Perforated Stainless Steel Scooper - Bags, Buckets, Boxes, Removes Unpopped Kerne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cT7Fx21QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scooping just got a lot faster!Pop Pop Pop! You can't say that's not the greatest sound to hear at a movie theater, unless it's opening night of a summer blockbuster and it's your shift. Five minutes before showtime, you've still got an endless sea of hungry cornheads out there demanding a jumbo-size bucket of popcorn! What do you do?The old-school popcorn scoop without perforation is a thing of the past. You need to get through the line before the previews end and you're scooping around that pile of unpopped kernels in case someone complains about too many being in their bucket. Take a breather and check out this Stainless-Steel Popcorn Speed Scoop from Back of House Ltd.This scoop is a first of its kind and features a dual handle design to accommodate left and right handed poppers alike! The Speed Scoop glides through popcorn while kernels slide right through the perforated holes in the stainless-steel, leaving your customers satisfied and begging for more 'corn. You won't find a faster, more efficient way to serve popcorn (and many other goodies) to your customers and yourself.But don't just serve popcorn! Serve French fries, ice, candy, desserts, dog and pet food, and other dry goods. Great for movie theaters, concession stands, carnivals, weddings, ice machines, popcorn machine supplies and personal home theater room poppers.I Smell Popcorn!Made to fill bags, boxes, and bowls in seconds while removing unpopped popcorn kernels from each scoop! Features a comfortable grip built for speed, so you can scoop out treats, quick and simple!As those in the business know, a good way to keep productive and pass the time is to track your SPH (scoops per hour) while on the job. You'll be cutting your SPH in no time! Nothing is faster on the market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cT7Fx21QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Back of House Ltd.","source_asin":"B0BX4RSS6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-453634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX4RSS6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX4RSS6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
